**Verdict: `3b947d79fd` does not clear epic #709 final acceptance.** Three-process gameplay is largely wired, but there are release-blocking HUD and opening-view defects, plus formal delivery gaps against the stated priorities.

*(Ask-mode note: shell `git` was blocked here; findings are from full path reads of the Frontline tip tree, acceptance profile/script, Core overlay/receipt/camera paths, and design docs. Re-run `git diff origin/main..3b947d79fd` locally if you need the merge-scope file list.)*

